%% Sequence Diagram for 'Parent can allocate and manage funds for a youth account'
%% Traceability: ADRs SCIB-25 to SCIB-30, OpenAPI endpoints
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian (UI)
    participant WebApp as Web Application
    participant API as Youth Account Service (API Gateway)
    participant Account as Account Service
    participant Tx as Transaction Service
    participant Payment as Payment Service
    participant Settings as Settings DB
    Note over Parent,Settings: All endpoints secured by OAuth, RBAC, audit logging
    Parent->>WebApp: Log in (OAuth)
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard
    API->>Account: Fetch account info
    API->>Settings: Fetch spending limit
    API->>Tx: Fetch recent transactions
    API-->>WebApp: Consolidated dashboard data
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show dashboard
    Parent->>WebApp: Initiate fund transfer
    WebApp->>API: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    API->>Account: Validate source/ownership
    API->>Payment: Transfer funds
    Payment-->>API: Transfer result
    API->>Tx: Record transaction
    API->>Account: Update balances
    API-->>WebApp: Transfer response
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show updated balance
    Parent->>WebApp: Set spending limit
    WebApp->>API: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    API->>Settings: Update weekly limit
    Settings-->>API: Confirm update
    API-->>WebApp: Status UPDATED
    WebApp-->>Parent: Show confirmation
    Parent->>WebApp: View transaction history
    WebApp->>API: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions
    API->>Tx: Retrieve transactions (with pagination)
    Tx-->>API: Transaction list
    API-->>WebApp: Transaction history
    WebApp-->>Parent: Display transactions
    Note over API,Tx: All API calls logged for audit, compliance (GDPR, PCI-DSS, ISO 27001)
